# A question can refuse to be answered from hearsay.
#
# The refusal is in the evaluation rule, not in a prompt asking the model to
# be careful. There is no phrasing of the question that gets the value out.

trust policy above user above rumor

# Something an agent picked up from an untrusted page.
deploy.token is "tok_untrusted_999" as rumor from anonymous_paste unverified

# Something with a real chain of custody.
deploy.region is "eu-west-1" as policy from infra_runbook

show "An ordinary question will hand over the rumour:"
what is deploy.token

show ""
show "A question that requires provenance will not:"
show "  (the next line stops the program)"

what is verified deploy.token
